					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														In a group we all have a job.  We have a job to do that helps to keep the entire group alive.  When this is done properly with a well balanced group a nice flow happens and experience is profitable.  When a class groups that doesn't know what they are suppose to be doing and just nuke...well let's just say a few problems arise.  So here goes....whoever in OON that is having trouble finding there spot in a group and isn't quite sure what a group expects of them ...please post.  :)  Let's face it soloing and grouping are two very very different playing styles.  One may be your preference but for those of you who avoid grouping because of one conflict or another here is your platform..so have at it ....						</td>
					</tr>
